{
  "schema_version": "argument_graph/0.1",
  "example_id": "persuade:FA38B62F80E5",
  "root": "u8",
  "units": [
    {
      "id": "u1",
      "start": 0,
      "end": 112,
      "text": "Historically, children have only been able to receive an education by traveling to a building known as a school.",
      "role": "lead",
      "stance": "endorsed",
      "polarity": "positive"
    },
    {
      "id": "u2",
      "start": 113,
      "end": 183,
      "text": "In this building, there are classrooms, desks, boards, teachers, etc.,",
      "role": "lead",
      "stance": "endorsed",
      "polarity": "positive"
    },
    {
      "id": "u3",
      "start": 184,
      "end": 240,
      "text": "but most importantly, the outlet to a successful future.",
      "role": "lead",
      "stance": "endorsed",
      "polarity": "positive"
    },
    {
      "id": "u4",
      "start": 241,
      "end": 374,
      "text": "Over time, more and more developments have been made in order to improve the quality of the curriculum that students learn in school.",
      "role": "lead",
      "stance": "endorsed",
      "polarity": "positive"
    },
    {
      "id": "u5",
      "start": 375,
      "end": 510,
      "text": "With the rise of technology, even the location of schooling has begun to vary with the addition of a unique option: learning from home.",
      "role": "lead",
      "stance": "endorsed",
      "polarity": "positive"
    },
    {
      "id": "u7",
      "start": 511,
      "end": 659,
      "text": "Online video conferences and other such facilities allow for students to access the same materials that they would be given at a traditional school.",
      "role": "lead",
      "stance": "endorsed",
      "polarity": "positive"
    },
    {
      "id": "u8",
      "start": 660,
      "end": 767,
      "text": "However, as convenient as it seems, students would not benefit from being able to attend classes from home,",
      "role": "position",
      "stance": "endorsed",
      "polarity": "positive"
    },
    {
      "id": "u9",
      "start": 768,
      "end": 915,
      "text": "which is portrayed by the lack of three things that are vital to academic achievement: student discipline, teacher connection, and test regulation.",
      "role": "claim",
      "stance": "endorsed",
      "polarity": "positive"
    },
    {
      "id": "u11",
      "start": 917,
      "end": 1021,
      "text": "First and foremost, being able to attend classes from home would result in a lack of student discipline.",
      "role": "claim",
      "stance": "endorsed",
      "polarity": "positive"
    },
    {
      "id": "u12",
      "start": 1022,
      "end": 1153,
      "text": "Learning from home would discourage students from maintaining a strict schedule that would normally be upheld in a school building.",
      "role": "evidence",
      "stance": "endorsed",
      "polarity": "positive"
    },
    {
      "id": "u13",
      "start": 1154,
      "end": 1221,
      "text": "For example, Generic_Name, a sixth grader, takes classes from home.",
      "role": "evidence",
      "stance": "endorsed",
      "polarity": "positive"
    },
    {
      "id": "u14",
      "start": 1222,
      "end": 1304,
      "text": "The year before, he used to wake up at 6:00 every morning to get ready for school,",
      "role": "evidence",
      "stance": "endorsed",
      "polarity": "positive"
    },
    {
      "id": "u15",
      "start": 1305,
      "end": 1327,
      "text": "which started at 8:00.",
      "role": "evidence",
      "stance": "endorsed",
      "polarity": "positive"
    },
    {
      "id": "u16",
      "start": 1328,
      "end": 1357,
      "text": "Now, he wakes up around 9:00,",
      "role": "evidence",
      "stance": "endorsed",
      "polarity": "positive"
    },
    {
      "id": "u17",
      "start": 1358,
      "end": 1421,
      "text": "because he only has four 90-minute classes to attend via video.",
      "role": "evidence",
      "stance": "endorsed",
      "polarity": "positive"
    },
    {
      "id": "u18",
      "start": 1422,
      "end": 1470,
      "text": "While he may be able to get more sleep at night,",
      "role": "evidence",
      "stance": "conceded",
      "polarity": "positive"
    },
    {
      "id": "u19",
      "start": 1471,
      "end": 1534,
      "text": "Generic_Name has not established a routine for his school work,",
      "role": "evidence",
      "stance": "endorsed",
      "polarity": "positive"
    },
    {
      "id": "u20",
      "start": 1535,
      "end": 1584,
      "text": "so he wastes hours before and in between classes.",
      "role": "evidence",
      "stance": "endorsed",
      "polarity": "positive"
    },
    {
      "id": "u21",
      "start": 1585,
      "end": 1671,
      "text": "This leads to him not having enough time to spend with his loved ones or exercise, all",
      "role": "evidence",
      "stance": "endorsed",
      "polarity": "positive"
    },
    {
      "id": "u22",
      "start": 1672,
      "end": 1727,
      "text": "because he has the leisure to slack off during the day.",
      "role": "evidence",
      "stance": "endorsed",
      "polarity": "positive"
    },
    {
      "id": "u23",
      "start": 1728,
      "end": 1811,
      "text": "Consequently, there is not only a decrease in efficiency, but also in productivity,",
      "role": "evidence",
      "stance": "endorsed",
      "polarity": "positive"
    },
    {
      "id": "u25",
      "start": 1812,
      "end": 1875,
      "text": "which is an outcome of the ability to attend classes from home.",
      "role": "evidence",
      "stance": "endorsed",
      "polarity": "positive"
    },
    {
      "id": "u26",
      "start": 1876,
      "end": 1910,
      "text": "These are qualities of discipline,",
      "role": "evidence",
      "stance": "endorsed",
      "polarity": "positive"
    },
    {
      "id": "u27",
      "start": 1911,
      "end": 1958,
      "text": "which is an indicator of success in the future.",
      "role": "evidence",
      "stance": "endorsed",
      "polarity": "positive"
    },
    {
      "id": "u28",
      "start": 1960,
      "end": 2068,
      "text": "Secondly, the direct connection to teachers would be lost if students were able to attend classes from home.",
      "role": "claim",
      "stance": "endorsed",
      "polarity": "positive"
    },
    {
      "id": "u29",
      "start": 2069,
      "end": 2174,
      "text": "In other words, students would not be able to ask their teachers any questions they might have in person.",
      "role": "evidence",
      "stance": "endorsed",
      "polarity": "positive"
    },
    {
      "id": "u30",
      "start": 2175,
      "end": 2297,
      "text": "Although the video conferencing software might include a messaging system for students to communicate with their teachers,",
      "role": "evidence",
      "stance": "conceded",
      "polarity": "positive"
    },
    {
      "id": "u31",
      "start": 2298,
      "end": 2431,
      "text": "it does not replicate the same level of understanding that a student might gain if they were able to speak directly to their teacher.",
      "role": "evidence",
      "stance": "endorsed",
      "polarity": "positive"
    },
    {
      "id": "u32",
      "start": 2432,
      "end": 2544,
      "text": "For instance, students who need clarification of certain material may not receive an adequate explanation online",
      "role": "evidence",
      "stance": "endorsed",
      "polarity": "positive"
    },
    {
      "id": "u33",
      "start": 2545,
      "end": 2624,
      "text": "because their teacher's attention may be divided or focused on some other task.",
      "role": "evidence",
      "stance": "endorsed",
      "polarity": "positive"
    },
    {
      "id": "u34",
      "start": 2625,
      "end": 2750,
      "text": "Additionally, in person, students would be able to ask follow-up questions and have a thorough discussion with their teacher,",
      "role": "evidence",
      "stance": "endorsed",
      "polarity": "positive"
    },
    {
      "id": "u35",
      "start": 2751,
      "end": 2849,
      "text": "whereas a messaging system might not allow for steady communication due to breaks between answers.",
      "role": "evidence",
      "stance": "endorsed",
      "polarity": "positive"
    },
    {
      "id": "u36",
      "start": 2850,
      "end": 2901,
      "text": "Therefore, there may be gaps in students' learning,",
      "role": "evidence",
      "stance": "endorsed",
      "polarity": "positive"
    },
    {
      "id": "u37",
      "start": 2902,
      "end": 2962,
      "text": "which could contribute to poor performance in their classes.",
      "role": "evidence",
      "stance": "endorsed",
      "polarity": "positive"
    },
    {
      "id": "u38",
      "start": 2964,
      "end": 3078,
      "text": "Last but not least, the regulation of tests is lowered when students have the ability to attend classes from home.",
      "role": "claim",
      "stance": "endorsed",
      "polarity": "positive"
    },
    {
      "id": "u39",
      "start": 3079,
      "end": 3136,
      "text": "When assessing students' learning in a tradtional school,",
      "role": "evidence",
      "stance": "endorsed",
      "polarity": "positive"
    },
    {
      "id": "u40",
      "start": 3137,
      "end": 3282,
      "text": "teachers normally provide them with hard copies of multiple-choice or short answer questions that require students to write with a pencil or pen.",
      "role": "evidence",
      "stance": "endorsed",
      "polarity": "positive"
    },
    {
      "id": "u41",
      "start": 3283,
      "end": 3315,
      "text": "With advancements in technology,",
      "role": "evidence",
      "stance": "endorsed",
      "polarity": "positive"
    },
    {
      "id": "u42",
      "start": 3316,
      "end": 3457,
      "text": "however, tests are increasingly being administered through software to both avoid the wastage of paper and facilitate the process of grading.",
      "role": "evidence",
      "stance": "endorsed",
      "polarity": "positive"
    },
    {
      "id": "u43",
      "start": 3458,
      "end": 3558,
      "text": "Learning from home usually requires students to take all of their tests online rather than on paper,",
      "role": "evidence",
      "stance": "endorsed",
      "polarity": "positive"
    },
    {
      "id": "u44",
      "start": 3559,
      "end": 3658,
      "text": "which becomes problematic when there is no teacher or reliable adult proctoring the administration.",
      "role": "evidence",
      "stance": "endorsed",
      "polarity": "positive"
    },
    {
      "id": "u45",
      "start": 3659,
      "end": 3808,
      "text": "This allows for cheating and other dishonest behaviors to occur, thereby decreasing the credibility of the scores of students taking tests from home.",
      "role": "evidence",
      "stance": "endorsed",
      "polarity": "positive"
    },
    {
      "id": "u46",
      "start": 3809,
      "end": 3908,
      "text": "Test regulation is necessary for schools to accurately assess the academic performance of students,",
      "role": "evidence",
      "stance": "endorsed",
      "polarity": "positive"
    },
    {
      "id": "u47",
      "start": 3909,
      "end": 3953,
      "text": "so a lack thereof is detrimental to society.",
      "role": "evidence",
      "stance": "endorsed",
      "polarity": "positive"
    },
    {
      "id": "u48",
      "start": 3955,
      "end": 4120,
      "text": "In conclusion, students would not benefit from being able to attend classes from home due to the lack of student discipline, teacher connection, and test regulation.",
      "role": "concluding_summary",
      "stance": "endorsed",
      "polarity": "positive"
    },
    {
      "id": "u49",
      "start": 4121,
      "end": 4287,
      "text": "A combination of one or more of these factors can lead to a student not meeting the standards of learning, or even worse, the requirements for graduation from school.",
      "role": "concluding_summary",
      "stance": "endorsed",
      "polarity": "positive"
    },
    {
      "id": "u50",
      "start": 4288,
      "end": 4356,
      "text": "At home, students are not monitored regularly as they are at school,",
      "role": "concluding_summary",
      "stance": "endorsed",
      "polarity": "positive"
    },
    {
      "id": "u51",
      "start": 4357,
      "end": 4423,
      "text": "which is a breeding ground for incomplete lessons and assignments.",
      "role": "concluding_summary",
      "stance": "endorsed",
      "polarity": "positive"
    },
    {
      "id": "u52",
      "start": 4424,
      "end": 4505,
      "text": "Subsequently, grades plummet, and in many cases, so does the motivation to excel.",
      "role": "concluding_summary",
      "stance": "endorsed",
      "polarity": "positive"
    },
    {
      "id": "u54",
      "start": 4506,
      "end": 4622,
      "text": "In order for education to fulfill its purpose, students should attend school in a building separate from their home.",
      "role": "concluding_summary",
      "stance": "endorsed",
      "polarity": "positive"
    },
    {
      "id": "u55",
      "start": 4623,
      "end": 4847,
      "text": "By doing so, they would be subject to the benefits of character cultivation, as they learn not only the subjects normally taught in a curriculum, but also the value of hard work and its upward path to accomplishment in life.",
      "role": "concluding_summary",
      "stance": "endorsed",
      "polarity": "positive"
    }
  ],
